"instance belongs to, as set in MISP.org, $contact = the e-mail address used "
"to contact the support team, as set in MISP.contact. For example, \"the "
"password for $username is $password\" would appear to a user with the e-mail "
"address user@misp.org as \"the password for user@misp.org is hNamJae81\"."
