"Keep in mind that the length is checked in another key. Default (simple 3 "
"out of 4 or minimum 16 characters): /^((?=.*\\d)|(?=.*\\W+))(?![\\n])(?=.*[A-"
"Z])(?=.*[a-z]).*$|.{16,}/"
msgstr ""

