msgid ""
"This trigger is called each time an Event or Attribute have been saved. This "
"means that when a large quantity of Attributes are being saved (e.g. Feed "
"pulling or synchronisation), the workflow will be run for as many time as "
"there are Attributes."
msgstr ""

#: Model/WorkflowModules/trigger/Module_event_before_save.php:20
msgid ""
"This trigger is called each time an Event or Attribute is about to be saved. "
"This means that when a large quantity of Attributes are being saved (e.g. "
"Feed pulling or synchronisation), the workflow will be run for as many time "
"as there are Attributes."
msgstr ""

