"This trigger is called each time a Shadow Attribute has been saved. This "
"means that when a large quantity of Shadow Attributes are being saved (e.g. "
"Feed pulling or synchronisation), the workflow will be run for as many time "
"as there are Shadow Attributes."
msgstr ""

#: Model/WorkflowModules/trigger/Module_shadow_attribute_before_save.php:20
msgid ""
"This trigger is called each time a Shadow Attribute is about to be saved. "
"This means that when a large quantity of Shadow Attributes are being saved "
"(e.g. Feed pulling or synchronisation), the workflow will be run for as many "
"time as there are Shadow Attributes."
msgstr ""

#: Model/WorkflowModules/trigger/Module_sighting_after_save.php:20
msgid ""
"This trigger is called each time a Sighting has been saved. This means that "
"when a large quantity of Sightings are being saved (e.g. Feed pulling or "
"synchronisation), the workflow will be run for as many time as there are "
